I used the **ai** variant: Cognee makes an open-source memory platform for AI agents (a Python SDK that turns documents, code and conversations into a knowledge graph with vector search), so its work is about RAG and agents. Flags: Hsan has no knowledge-graph or graph-database experience (the CV shows his Qdrant/Pinecone vector search instead); Cognee's default stack is Postgres/PGVector, which isn't in facts.yaml; it ships an MCP server and a Rust engine, and Hsan has neither listed; the only internship-type opening I found (AI Engineer Working Student, Berlin) is on a third-party job board ([arbeitnow](https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/topoteretes-ug-haftungsbeschrankt/ai-engineering-workingstudent-berlin-483808)), not on cognee.ai.
